{"sourceUrl":"http://opt.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c72729a3193869/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.384098+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://opt.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c72729a3193869/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>光电学院推荐免试报名于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日开始，</span><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>24</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>24</span></strong><strong><span>时</span></strong><span><span>截止。请有意申请我院推荐免试研究生的同学务必于截止时间前通过系统进行报名。具体方法及要求详见浙江大学研究生院网站：浙江大学关于</span><span>2027年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</span></span></p><p><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm。</span></p><p><strong><span>报名系统提交材料：</span></strong><strong><span>有效身份证扫描件、</span></strong><strong><span>本科阶段学习成绩单及排名证明</span></strong><span>（成绩单与排名证明须加盖教务处或院系公章）</span><span>、</span><strong><span>外语水平证明</span></strong><span>【申请直接攻博的同学英语成绩需满足全国大学英语六级成绩总分</span><span>460</span><span>分及以上或</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）达到合格标准或英语专业八级合格（以上英语成绩有效期</span><span>5</span><span><span>年，</span><a href=\"http://opt.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c72729a3193869/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><span>2022</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span><span>1日及之后的成绩有效</span><span>）或英语国家获得过学士学位或雅思</span></span><span>5.5</span><span>及以上或托福</span><span>80</span><span>及以上（有效期参照证书有效期，至</span><span>202</span><span>7年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日，证书需在有效期内】等其他证明材料。如果有已发表的学术论文等科研成果，或有科技活动获奖的，请提交证明材料</span><strong><span>（上述所有材料请</span></strong><strong><span>分别</span></strong><strong><span>命名扫描成</span></strong><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>文件后压缩上传，</span></strong><strong><span>不要合并</span></strong><strong><span>成同一个</span></strong><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>文件）</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>其中，申请直博的同学还须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见。（模板详见附件，推荐信内容可打印，需要专家本人亲笔签字）请于复试当天现场提交。</span></p><p><span><span>联系人：祝老师，联系方式：</span><span>yhzhu</span></span><span>@zju.edu.cn</span><span>，</span><span>0571-87952637</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> 附件<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/674165dc44c2f493b510.gif\"/><a href=\"http://opt.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/56/fd/e0dd15094965a14d5ef5681ee357/4b2aa4c7-5427-4bd8-894f-bbff6d26f575.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家推荐书.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"bcb93755e660c8f146b2726306a60516ea324b42a3bcbc8ac76cddaa1a0fac75","textLength":627,"sourceSha256":"61d28b681bca0b5b71e316d88419e93484f858519a38251324f7269481c69b6a","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2a345a4ab59ecf714779","title":"2026年浙江大学光电科学与工程学院关于接收2027级推荐免试研究生的说明","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.384098+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://opt.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/674165dc44c2f493b510.gif"}]}
